# KDE's colour groups for ~/.config/kdeglobals, generated with Matugen from
# the wallpaper. KDE apps (Dolphin, Kate, Ark...) draw with these next to
# the Qt palette. kde-colors.sh puts them into kdeglobals, replacing only
# its colour groups.

